# No real patient data (PHI)

Never put real patient data in this repo or in anything written while working in it.

Forbidden in prompts, commits, logs, comments, screenshots, fixtures, mocks, and sample payloads:

- Real patient names
- Medical record numbers (MRNs)
- Dates of birth
- Any other real identifiers or clinical facts tied to a real person

Use synthetic data only. Invented names, fake MRNs, and made-up dates are required.

```ts
// BAD — real or production-looking patient identity
const patient = { name: 'Maria Santos', mrn: 'EHR-88421', birthDate: '1974-03-12' };

// GOOD — clearly synthetic fixture
const patient = { name: 'Jane Doe', mrn: 'MRN-0001', birthDate: '1990-01-01' };
```

If real PHI appears in an error, log, or paste, do not repeat it. Redact and replace with synthetic values before committing or continuing.
